  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Phase 2 Innovative Metrics and Methods in Agriculture and Nutrition (IMMANA)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The second phase of this programme aims to contribute to the goal of generating high quality evidence linking agriculture and food systems to healthy, safe, nutritious diets.  It builds on the strong performance under the initial phase of IMMANA, as evidenced in the External Mid-Term Review.  The purpose of the programme will be to stimulate innovations in robust methodological approaches to impact assessment in agriculture and human nutrition/health, including the development of novel indicators and metrics</narrative>
  </description>
